    "description": "Garden (level 1), level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. A 15 x 15 cottage garden set into the lawn: a low hedge, gravel paths and a round walk round a sundial bed, curved flower borders; later levels add trees, azaleas, an arbor, benches, lanterns and dense mixed flowers. Not yet builder-tested: allium, azalea, azalea_leaves, azure_bluet, birch_leaves, birch_log, cherry_leaves, cherry_log, cornflower, dandelion, flowering_azalea, flowering_azalea_leaves, grass_block, lily_of_the_valley, orange_tulip, oxeye_daisy, pink_tulip, red_tulip, white_tulip.",
